{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方最大字号的白色两行标题，首先吸引视线，尤其是“那点没底越来越具体”和“对方不再需要他的陪伴”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"隐约抓到他在担心有一天对方不再需要自己的陪伴，甚至不愿意和自己待在一起。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、担忧、不安。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他因此一下安静下来，不敢继续往远处想；随后想起对方一直没有退开、两人眼下仍然亲近，因此又有一点高兴。这层从担忧到得到安慰的情绪变化，第一眼不容易抓到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的白色大字争夺主视线，标题、安静下来的反应、重新想起亲近的事实都有较强视觉权重。\",\n    \"顶部标题是较长的问句，需要读过多个部分才能完整理解担忧的具体内容。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里：担忧的原因在顶部，当前反应在中间，情绪转折在下面，需要拼接才能理解完整处境和感受关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ef1fb022-8f01-42fd-a75b-ad19839db685", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T025905348752Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:59:44.964942+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "dce5a1a87ecc618bbdb70edb0c80857c42f473fe2800393e46c371b75cfd29b6", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc